Replace empty "text" fields with translated prayer content, then run:
  powershell -File scripts/build-prayers-import.ps1 -Language es -InputFile path/to/es.json

Or paste the full translated JSON into public/prayers/es.json and run build-prayers.ps1
(which regenerates es.js from es.json if you add import logic).

For now, edit public/prayers/es.json directly and re-run scripts/build-prayers.ps1.
